    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue</a></i></p><p><i>See also:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a></i></p><p>You know how to dishearten your opponents when they least expect it.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> 13</p><p><b>Effect:</b> When you successfully deal damage to an opponent with an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attack_of_Opportunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack of Opportunity\">Attack of Opportunity</a>, you can immediately make a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">Persuasion</a> check to <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Intimidate\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Intimidate\">Intimidate</a> the opponent as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Free_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Free Action\">Free Action</a>.</p>",
